    {
     "id": "quote",
     "kind": "text",
     "z": 43,
     "box": [
      262,
      642,
      880,
      166
     ],
     "runs": [
      {
       "text": "The phosphors of "
      },
      {
       "text": "Sr4.75-5x-5yCa5xBa5y(PO4)2(SiO4):Eu0.252+ (0.01 ≤ x ≤ 1; 0.01 ≤ y ≤ 0.5)",
       "color": "#F59E0B",
       "bold": true
      },
      {
       "text": " were prepared: I) Sr4.75-5xCa5x((PO4)(SiO4)0.5)2:Eu0.252+ (0.01 ≤ x ≤ 0.95); and II) Sr4.75-5yBa5y(PO4) 2(SiO4):Eu0.252+ (y = 0.01, 0.05, 0.1, 0.2, 0.5). The starting materials were "
      },
      {
       "text": "CaCO3 (99.99%), SrCO3 (99.99%), BaCO3 (99.99%), NH4H2PO4 (99.99%), SiO2 (99.99%), Eu2O3 (99.99%)",
       "color": "#E97132",
       "bold": true
      },
      {
       "text": ". The stoichiometric chemicals "
      },
      {
       "text": "were weighed and thoroughly mixed in an agate mortar, then transferred to a corundum crucible",
       "color": "#12946B",
       "bold": true
      },
      {
       "text": " and "
      },
      {
       "text": "heated at 350 (in air), 1000 (in air) and 1300 °C (in reducing (h2) atmosphere)",
       "color": "#154A97",
       "bold": true
      },
      {
       "text": " for 15 h, respectively. In the experiments no signals from Eu3+ were detected on the emission spectra, indicating the Eu3+ ions were successfully reduced to Eu2+ ions in the present experimental conditions."
      }
     ],
     "font_size": 14.5,
     "font_family": "DejaVu Sans",
     "cjk_font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
     "bold": false,
     "color": "#1B2B3A",
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "top",
